OL,3,GNEWSAMy hometown shows that high
OL,4,Astreets have to change or die
OL,5,
OL,6,FMy hometown shows that high streets
OL,7,Fhave to change or die
OL,9,FThe empty building that used to be the
OL,10,Fhome of Marks & Spencer in Aberdeen is
OL,11,Fone of the first things you see when
OL,12,Fyou arrive off the train and come into
OL,13,Fthe city centre. The sign has gone,
OL,14,Fthough the shape of the lettering can
OL,15,Fstill be made out; the windows are
OL,16,Fblacked out and the doors boarded up.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
