OL,3,GNEWSAMy hometown shows that high
OL,4,Astreets have to change or die
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis is my hometown. As a teenager, I
OL,7,Fspent hours on Union Street, its main
OL,8,Fthoroughfare, nicknamed the Granite
OL,9,FMile after the local silver-grey stone.
OL,10,FIt was the place to try on all the
OL,11,Flatest fashions from the likes of
OL,12,FClockhouse and Chelsea Girl.
OL,14,FThe street used to be packed with
OL,15,Fshoppers from across the north-east of
OL,16,FScotland.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
